  "title": "Smoked Turkey Wild Rice Soup",
  "description": "A comforting bowl of creamy smoked turkey soup, full of vegetables and wild rice, makes a warm and fragrant meal when the cold winds blow.",
  "authors": [
    "MAERYON74"
  ],
